OL,3,GNEWSAAI data centres could undermine
OL,4,AUK's emissions goals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government's ambition of
OL,7,Fachieving net zero carbon emissions by
OL,8,F2050 could be undermined by its new
OL,9,Fdeal on AI data centres, according to
OL,10,FBBC research.
OL,12,FDuring Wednesday's Budget speech,
OL,13,FChancellor John Healey said data
OL,14,Fcentres would be allowed to build
OL,15,Fonsite power generation while they wait
OL,16,Ffor a grid connection.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
