OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAI data centres could undermine
OL,4,AUK's emissions goals
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC File on 4 Investigates has
OL,7,Fdiscovered that four planned
OL,8,F"hyperscale" data centres - including
OL,9,Fthree in the south of England - are
OL,10,Falready considering using gas-fired
OL,11,Fpower to meet their electricity needs,
OL,12,Fcreating more CO2 than the cities of
OL,13,FManchester, Liverpool and Southampton
OL,14,Fcombined.
OL,16,FLabour MP Toby Perkins, who chairs the
OL,17,FEnvironmental Audit Select Committee,
OL,18,Fsaid a substantial increase in the use
OL,19,Fof natural gas "can't be the future".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
